| Criterion | Threshold | Decision layer |
| Gravimetric energy density | >= 327.18 Wh/kg | stage2 |
| 4C fast charge, no lithium plating | plated = false (anode surface potential difference at separator interface min >= 0 V) | stage3 |
| Anode SEI thickness after 100 cycles 1C | <= 500 nm | stage2 |
| Discharge capacity retention at -20 C | >= 0.90 | stage2 |
| Anode SEI thickness after 500 cycles 1C | <= 550 nm | stage2 |

## 2. Selected design: L "AnPorUp"
Base: Chen2020 NMC811/graphite SPMe (teaching parameterization), start_stage 3.
