| Parameter | Baseline | Design L |
| Positive current collector thickness | 16 um | 10 um |
| Negative current collector thickness | 12 um | 8 um |
| Negative electrode porosity | 0.25 | 0.35 |
| Nominal cell capacity | 5.0 Ah | 4.9506 Ah (measured 1C, honest bookkeeping) |
All other parameters at Chen2020 baseline (separator 12 um/0.47, negative electrode 85.2 um, positive 75.6 um, particles 5.86/5.22 um, electrolyte Nyman2008 functions, t+ 0.2594, h 10).

## 3. Measured performance (all values from tool outputs, cell/*.json)
| Criterion | Target | Measured | Verdict |
| ED | >=327.18 Wh/kg | 476.72 | PASS |
| 4C no plating | anode min >= 0 V | -0.3868 V | FAIL |
| SEI 100 cyc | <=500 nm | 467.6 | PASS |
| lowT retention | >=0.90 | 0.9944 | PASS |
| SEI 500 cyc | <=550 nm | 811.3 | FAIL |

