- C SmallNeg: best SEI500 771.4, ED 407.0, plating -0.4368.
- D LowLoad: 2nd-best plating -0.4067, ED 355.6, SEI500 836.8.

## 6. Honest protocol annotations
- lowT_discharge protocol (tool definition): 1C discharge, ambient 253.15 K (-20 C), lumped thermal from 25 C initial; T_max 298.15 K (initial) — the cell cools during the test; retention vs same-rate 1C reference. Values are mechanical per this definition.
